<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Every word the app says, in the language it was written in. values-nl and values-fr carry the
  same keys; a key missing there falls back to this file rather than to nothing.

  Not a stored shape: nothing here reaches DataStore, so renaming a key costs a compile error and
  never a practice log. What is stored and shown — a preset's name, a reminder's name — stays the
  user's own text and is not translated, including the ones the app starts with.
-->
